              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "a carruagem — \"the carriage (of a train); the coach (horse-drawn)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "O nosso lugar é na carruagem cinco. Our seat is in carriage five."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In Brazil a train carriage is o vagão."
            }
          ]
        },
