          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "carruagem came from Spanish carruaje, which came from Catalan carruatge (EtymDB); the family goes back to Latin carrus 'cart'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
